<title>SWEDEN: Sweden okays Swedbank, Foreningsbanken.</title>
<headline>Sweden okays Swedbank, Foreningsbanken.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish Finance Inspectorate has approved the planned merger between banking groups Swedbank and Foreningsbanken, Swedbank said on Friday.</p>
</text>
